Although the database entry lists a molecular weight of 130.1 Da, this is chemically incorrect for $\text{SiF}_4$ ($\text{Si} \approx 28.09\text{ Da} + 4 \times \text{F} \approx 4 \times 19.00\text{ Da} = 104.08\text{ Da}$).

